node_modules/
# dist/ is COMMITTED for packages/* — this monorepo is consumed as a git
# dependency (github:...#path:), and pnpm prepares git deps with npm, which
# cannot resolve the workspace:* dependency between the two packages. Shipping
# dist removes build-on-install entirely. Rebuild (pnpm build) before
# committing source changes.
